@startuml
title 3. Authenticated request (local JWT validation)
autonumber
participant Client
participant Gateway
participant "Any Service" as Svc
database Redis

Client -> Gateway : GET /... (Authorization: Bearer access)
Gateway -> Gateway : validate JWT signature locally (JWKS)\ncheck exp
alt signature/exp invalid
    Gateway --> Client : 401
else valid
    Gateway -> Redis : is jti in denylist?
    alt denylisted (revoked)
        Redis --> Gateway : yes
        Gateway --> Client : 401
    else allowed
        Gateway -> Svc : forward request + user claims
        Svc --> Gateway : 200 response
        Gateway --> Client : 200
    end
end
@enduml
